{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"卷九百九十三◎藥部十","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"○桔梗","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《廣雅》曰：犁如，桔梗。","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《管子》曰：五沃之土生桔梗。","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《范子計然》曰：桔梗出河東洛陽。","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《戰國策》曰：淳於髡一日而見七士於宣王，王曰：\"寡人聞：千里之一士，是比肩而相望；百世一聖，若隨踵而生也。今子一朝而見七士，士不亦眾乎？\"淳於髡曰：\"夫鳥同翼者聚飛，獸馱葶者俱行。今求桔梗於沮泽，累世不能得一；之皋黍梁父之陰，則却車載耳。王求士於髡，譬挹水於河，取火於燧也。\"","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《建康記》曰：建康出桔梗，極精好。","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《搜神記》曰：鄱陽趙寿有犬蠱。有陳岑詣寿，忽有大黃犬六七，群出吠岑，後餘伯歸與寿婦食，吐血幾死。屑桔梗以飲之，乃愈。","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《本草經》曰：桔梗，一名犁如。味辛微溫。生山穀。治胸胁痛、腸鳴、驚悸。生嵩高。","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《吳氏本草經》曰：桔梗，一名符蔰，一名白藥，一名利如，一明澹草，一名盧茹。神農、医和距，無毒；扁鵲、黃帝鹹；歧伯、雷够允，無毒；李氏大寒。葉如荠苨，茎如筆管，紫赤。二月生。","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"○巴豆","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《廣雅》曰：巴菽，巴豆也。","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_13","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《蜀志》曰：犍為南安縣出巴豆。","sortOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《晉書》曰：贾後使太医令程據合巴豆杏子丸，矯詔使黃門孫慮赍至許昌，以害太子。","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《列仙傳》曰：玄俗，河間人，餌巴豆、雲英，賣一丸七錢。","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"盛弘之《荆州記》曰：朐〈月忍〉縣有巴子城，地多巴豆。","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_17","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《廣志》曰：犍為僰道縣出巴豆。","sortOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_18","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《博物志》曰：鼠食巴豆，三年重三十斤。","sortOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_19","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《本草經》曰：巴豆，一名巴菽。味辛溫。生川穀。主治溫疟、傷寒熱，破癖瘕結堅，通六府，去惡肉，除鬼毒邪註，殺虫。生巴蜀郡。","sortOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_20","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《范子計然》曰：巴菽出巴兢。","sortOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_21","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《吳氏本草經》曰：巴豆，一名菽。神農、歧伯、桐君辛，有毒；黃帝甘，有毒；李氏主溫熱寒。葉如大豆。八月彩。","sortOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_22","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"○鬼臼","sortOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_23","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《吳氏本草經》曰：一名九臼，一名天臼，一名雀犀，一名馬目公，一名解毒。生九真山穀，及冤句。二月、八月彩根。","sortOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_24","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"○莽草","sortOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_25","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《范子計然》曰：莽草出三辅，青色者善。","sortOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_26","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《淮南萬畢術》曰：莽草浮魚。(取莽草葉併陳粟米，合捣之，以內水，魚皆死。)","sortOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_27","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《本草經》曰：莽草，味辛溫。生山穀。治風頭、痈乳、疝瘕、結氣、疥瘙、疽瘡。生還穀。","sortOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_28","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《吳氏本草經》曰：莽，一名春草。神農辛，雷公、桐君苦，有毒。生上穀山中，或冤句。五月彩，治風。","sortOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_29","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"○忍冬","sortOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_30","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《本草經》曰：忍冬，味甘，久服輕身","sortOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_31","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"○淫羊霍","sortOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_32","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《本草經》曰：淫羊霍，一名蜀前。味辛寒。治陰痿、傷中，益氣強志，除茎痛，利小便。生上郡陽山。","sortOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_33","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《吳氏本草經》曰：淫羊霍，神農、雷公辛，季氏小寒。堅骨。","sortOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_34","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"○狼牙","sortOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_35","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《本草經》曰：狼牙，一名牙子。味寒。生川穀。治邪氣，去白虫、疥、痔。生淮南。","sortOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_36","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《建康記》曰：建康出狼牙。","sortOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_37","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《范子計然》曰：狼牙出三辅，色白者善。","sortOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_38","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《吳氏本草經》曰：狼牙，一名支蘭，一名狼齒，一名犬牙，一名抱牙。神農、黃帝苦，有毒，桐君鹹；歧伯、雷公、扁鵲苦，無毒。或生冤句。葉青，根黃赤。六月、七月華，八月實黑。正月、八月彩根。","sortOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_39","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"○香蒲","sortOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_40","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《本草經》曰：香蒲，一名睢蒲。味甘平。生池泽。治五藏心下邪氣，堅齒明目聰耳。久服，輕身能老。生南海。","sortOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_41","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《吳氏本草》曰：醮，一名醮石，一名香蒲。神農、雷够允。生南海池泽中。","sortOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_42","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"○爵李","sortOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_43","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《本草經》曰：鬱核，一名爵李。","sortOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_44","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"○腐婢","sortOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_45","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《本草經》曰：腐婢，小豆花也。","sortOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_46","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"○落石","sortOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_47","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《本草經》曰：落石，一名鯪石。味苦溫。生川穀。治風熱。久服輕身，明目，润泽好顏色，不老延年。生太山。","sortOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_48","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《吳氏本草經！曰：落石，一名鱗石，一名明石，一名縣石，一名雲華，一名雲珠，一名雲英，一名雲丹。神農苦，小溫；雷公苦，無毒；扁鵲、桐君甘，無毒；李氏大寒，雲藥中君。彩無時。","sortOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_49","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"○鬼箭","sortOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_50","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《廣雅》曰：鬼箭，神箭也。","sortOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_51","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《本草經》曰：衛矛，一明屙箭。味苦寒。生川穀。治女子崩中、下血、腹滿、汗出，除邪，殺鬼毒。生霍山。","sortOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_52","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《吳氏本草經》曰：鬼箭，一名衛矛。神農、黃帝、桐君苦，無毒。葉如桃如羽。正月、二月、七月彩，陰乾。或生野田。","sortOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_53","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"○房葵","sortOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_54","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《博物志》曰：房葵，與狼毒相似。","sortOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_55","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《本草經》曰：房葵，一名梨蓋。味辛。冬生川穀。久服，堅骨髓，益氣。生臨淄。","sortOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_56","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《吳氏本草經》曰：房葵，一名梁蓋，一名爵離，一名房苑，一名晨草，一名利如，一名方蓋。神農辛，小寒，桐君、扁鵲無毒，歧伯、雷公、黃帝苦，無毒。茎葉如葵，上黑黃。二月生根，根大如桔梗根，中紅白。六月花白，七月、八月實白。三月三日彩根。","sortOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_57","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"○麻黃","sortOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_58","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《廣雅》曰：龍沙，麻黃也。麻黃茎，狗骨也。","sortOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_59","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《本草經》曰：一名龍沙。味苦溫。生川穀。治中風、傷寒、出汗，去熱邪氣，破堅積聚。生晉地。","sortOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_60","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《范子計然》曰：麻黃出漢中三辅。","sortOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_61","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《吳氏本草經》曰：麻黃，一名卑相，一名卑監。神農、雷公苦，無毒；扁鵲酸，無毒；李氏平。或生河東。四月立秋彩。","sortOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_62","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"慕容晃與顧和書曰：今致麻黃五斤。","sortOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_63","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"○茈葫(柴胡二音)","sortOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_64","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《本草經》曰：茈葫，一名地薰。味苦平。生川穀。治心腹，祛腸胃結氣。久服輕身，明目益精。生弘農。","sortOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_65","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《吳氏本草經》曰：茈葫，一名山來，一名茹草。神農、歧伯、雷公苦，無毒。生冤句。二月、八月彩根。","sortOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_66","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"○亭歷","sortOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_67","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《爾雅》曰：蕇，(音典。)亭歷。(實、葉皆似芹，一明宸荠。)","sortOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_68","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《淮南子》曰：亭歷冬生。","sortOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_69","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《周髀》曰：凡北極左右，物有朝生暮獲，謂亭歷、冬生之類。","sortOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_70","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"○紫苑","sortOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_71","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《遊名山志》曰：石室紫苑。","sortOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_72","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《吳氏本草經》曰：紫苑，一名青苑。","sortOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_73","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"○女萎","sortOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_74","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《本草經》曰：女萎，一名左眄，一名玉竹。味辛。生川穀。久服，輕身能老。生太山。","sortOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_75","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"○蓍實","sortOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_76","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《本草經》曰：荛實，味苦酸，平，無毒。主益氣，充肌膚，明目聰惠，先知。久服，不飢不老，輕身。生少室山穀。八月、九月彩實，日乾。","sortOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_77","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"○地椹","sortOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_78","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《本草經》曰：地椹，一名石龍芮，一名食果能。味苦，平。生川泽。治風寒。久服，輕身明目，不老。生太山。","sortOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_79","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《范子計然》曰：石龍芮，出三辅，色黃者善。","sortOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_80","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《吳氏本草經》曰：石龍芮，一名薑苔，一名天豆。神農苦，平；歧伯酸；扁鵲、李氏大寒；雷公鹹，無毒。五月五日彩。","sortOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_81","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"○黃環","sortOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_82","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《本草經》曰：黃環，一名陵泉，一名大就。味苦。生山穀。主治虫毒、鬼魅、邪氣、咳逆、寒熱。生蜀郡。","sortOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_83","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《范子計然》曰：黃環，出魏郡，黃色者善。","sortOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_84","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《吳氏本草經》曰：蜀黃環，一名生蒭，一名根韭。神農、黃帝、歧伯、桐君、扁鵲辛，一經味苦，有毒。二月生，初出正赤，高二尺，葉黃員端，大茎，葉有汁，黃白。五月實員。三月彩根，根黃，從理如車輻，解治蠱毒。","sortOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_85","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"○菟絲","sortOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_86","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《爾雅》曰：唐蒙、女萝，菟絲也。","sortOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_87","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《廣雅》曰：女萝，松萝也。菟丘，菟絲也。","sortOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_88","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《史記·龟策傳》曰：下有伏苓，上有菟絲。","sortOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_89","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《博物志》曰：女萝，菟絲。寄草上，根不著地。","sortOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_90","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《呂氏春秋》曰：或謂菟絲無根。非無根也，其不屬也，伏苓是也。","sortOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_91","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《淮南子》曰：芩絲無根而生。伏苓抽，菟絲死。","sortOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_92","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《抱朴子》曰：案，仙方中自有合離草，一名獨搖，一名離母。所以謂之合離，下根如芋魁，有遊子十二枚，周環之，大魁數尺。雖相須生，而實不連，以氣相屬耳。如菟絲之草，下有伏苓之根，無此菟在下，則絲不得生於上。","sortOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_93","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"又曰：初生之根，其形似兔。掘取，刻其血，以和丹服之，立变化，在意所作。","sortOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_94","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《吳氏本草經》曰：兔絲實，一名玉女，一名松萝，一名鳥萝，一名鴞萝，一名复實，一名赤網。生山穀。","sortOrder":94},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_95","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"劉楨詩曰：青青女萝草，上依高松枝。幸蒙庇眷恩，為惠不可訾。","sortOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_96","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"○石芸","sortOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_97","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《爾雅》曰：茢，勃茢也。(郭璞症曰：一名石共，音列。)","sortOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_98","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《范子計然》曰：石芸出三辅。","sortOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_99","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"○甘遂","sortOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_100","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《廣雅》曰：陵旱，甘遂也。","sortOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_101","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《建康記》曰：建康出甘遂。","sortOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_102","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《本草經》曰：甘遂，味苦寒。生川穀。治大腹、疝瘕、脹滿、面目浮肿，除留飲宿食。出中山。","sortOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_103","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《范子計然》曰：甘遂出三辅。","sortOrder":103},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_104","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《吳氏本草經》曰：甘遂，一名主田，一名日泽，一名重泽，一明屙丑，一名陵藁，一名甘藁，一名苦泽。神農、桐君苦，有毒；歧伯、雷公有毒。須二月、八月彩。","sortOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_105","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"○馬刀","sortOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_106","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《本草經》曰：馬刀，味辛微寒。生池泽。治補中，漏下、赤白、留寒熱，破石淋，殺禽獸賊鼠。生江海。","sortOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_107","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《范子計然》曰：馬刀出河東。","sortOrder":107},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_108","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《吳氏本草經》曰：馬刀，一名齊蛤。(古納切。)神農、歧伯、桐君鹹，有毒；扁鵲小寒，大毒。生池泽江海。彩無時也。","sortOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_109","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"○女青","sortOrder":109},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_110","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《本草經》曰：女青，一名雀翾。味辛平。生山穀。治蠱毒，逐邪殺鬼。生朱崖。","sortOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_111","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《羅浮山記》曰：又有男青，似女青。","sortOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_112","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《吳氏本草經》曰：女青，一名霍由祗。神農、黃帝辛。","sortOrder":112},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_113","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"○王孫","sortOrder":113},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_114","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《本草經》曰：王孫，味苦平。治五藏邪氣、濕痹、四肢疼酸。生海西。","sortOrder":114},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_115","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《吳氏本草經》曰：黃孫，一名王孫，一名蔓延，一明瀚草，一名海孫。神農、雷公苦，無毒；黃帝甘，無毒。生西海山穀，及汝南城郭垣下。蔓延，赤文，茎葉相當。","sortOrder":115},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_116","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"○因尘","sortOrder":116},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_117","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《爾雅》曰：因尘，馬生也。","sortOrder":117},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_118","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《本草經》曰：因尘蒿，味苦。治風濕、寒熱、邪氣結、黃疽。久服，輕身益氣，能老。生太山。","sortOrder":118},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_119","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《吳氏本草》曰：因尘，神農、歧伯、雷公苦，無毒；黃帝辛，無毒。生田中，葉如藍。十一月彩。","sortOrder":119},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_120","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"○淮術","sortOrder":120},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_121","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《吳氏本草》曰：淮術，神農、雷公無毒。生晉平陽、河東平泽。治久咳上氣、傷中羸虛，補中益氣。","sortOrder":121},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_122","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"○百部","sortOrder":122},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_123","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《抱朴子·內篇》曰：百部苗似拔葜，治咳，殺蝨。","sortOrder":123},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_124","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《博物志》曰：百部與門冬相似。","sortOrder":124},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_125","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"○千歲垣中膚皮","sortOrder":125},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_126","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《吳氏本草》曰：千歲垣中膚皮，得薑、赤石脂共治。","sortOrder":126},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_127","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"○蒛葐","sortOrder":127},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_128","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《爾雅》曰：茥，(音奎。)蒛葐。(复盆也，實似莓而小，可食。)","sortOrder":128},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_129","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《吳氏本草》曰：缺盆，一名复盆。","sortOrder":129},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_130","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"○蒱陰實","sortOrder":130},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_131","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《吳氏本草》曰：蒱陰實，生平穀，或圃中。延蔓如瓜，葉實如桃。七月彩。止溫延年。","sortOrder":131},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_993_132","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_993","text":"《太平御覽》　宋·李昉","sortOrder":132}],"overrides":{}}